            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: '7 Card Draw: each player gets seven cards, then may draw/discard (typically once) to improve. Best five-card hand wins. Less common than 5 Card Draw; often limit or pot-limit. USA.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: "American draw poker variant; seven cards instead of five, one (or two) draw round(s). Less common than 5 Card Draw; popular in home and dealer's choice games.",
              },
            ],
          },
